# Documents Module

> Centralized document repository for managing all acquisition-related files throughout the mineral acquisition lifecycle.

---

# Overview

The Documents module provides a secure, centralized repository for all files associated with Deals, Assets, Owners, Campaigns, Title Review, Curative, Closing, and Payments.

It eliminates scattered files across email, shared drives, and local storage by maintaining version-controlled, searchable, and auditable records.

Every uploaded document is linked to one or more business records and tracked throughout its lifecycle.

---

# Objectives

The Documents module enables users to:

- Store acquisition documents securely
- Link documents to operational records
- Track document status
- Maintain version history
- Support title examination
- Organize closing packages
- Improve document search
- Enable AI-powered document analysis

