# Business Rules

## Rule 1

Every document must be linked to at least one business record.

---

## Rule 2

Filed documents become read-only.

---

## Rule 3

Document deletion is restricted to Administrators.

---

## Rule 4

Each upload creates a new audit log entry.

---

## Rule 5

Version history must be preserved.

